LevlPrep — licensing
====================

This repository contains two different kinds of work, under two different
licences. Which one applies depends on what you are copying.


1. CONTENT — Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

Applies to the study material: the question banks and their explanations, the
study notes, the Organic Chemistry lessons, notes and mechanism walkthroughs,
the Anatomy & Physiology lessons, notes, questions, tool content and LevlPrep's
own diagrams, the branching scenarios, the glossaries, flashcards, mnemonics,
skill sheets, flow diagrams and body-map descriptions. In file terms,
everything under:

    nremt/assets/*.json
    nremt/study-notes.html, glossary.html, mnemonics.html, skillsheets.html,
      flowcharts.html, scenario-sim.html, body-map.html   (their text content)
    ochem/notes/, ochem/lessons/, ochem/mechanisms/        (their text content)
    ochem/assets/*.json, ochem/data/
    anatomy-physiology/notes/, anatomy-physiology/lessons/,
      anatomy-physiology/chapters/, anatomy-physiology/concepts/
                                                           (their text content)
    anatomy-physiology/data/
    anatomy-physiology/assets/*.json, anatomy-physiology/assets/bank/,
      anatomy-physiology/assets/tool-data/
    anatomy-physiology/figures/*.svg                       (LevlPrep's own;
      the os-*.jpg figures there are OpenStax's, see section 3)

You are free to share and adapt this material for non-commercial purposes,
with attribution to LevlPrep (https://levlprep.com) and an indication of any
changes made. You may not use it for commercial purposes.

Full text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/legalcode
Summary:   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

The non-commercial term is the point of it. LevlPrep itself charges for
Premium: a one-time pass that adds unlimited practice, exams, analytics and
some interactive tools on top of the free teaching material (notes, textbook
sections, glossaries, flashcards and each course's free allowance). The
teaching material stays free on the site. Only LevlPrep, as the copyright
holder, may use the material commercially; this licence does not let anyone
else repackage or sell it, or put it behind their own paywall. Using it to
teach (in a classroom, a study group, or a course you do not charge for) is
exactly what it is for, and needs no permission beyond the attribution.


